div class="flex min-h-full flex-col justify-center py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"
  div class="sm:mx-auto sm:w-full sm:max-w-md"
    h2 class="text-center text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900" Mot de passe oublié ?
    p class="mt-3 text-center text-sm text-gray-600"
      | Indique ton adresse email. Si tu es parent d'un joueur, tu recevras un lien de connexion, sans mot de passe.

  div class="mt-8 sm:mx-auto sm:w-full sm:max-w-md"
    div class="bg-white py-8 px-4 shadow-sm sm:rounded-lg sm:px-10"
      = simple_form_for(resource, as: resource_name, url: password_path(resource_name), html: { method: :post, class: 'space-y-6' }) do |f|
        = f.error_notification
        = f.input :email, required: true, autofocus: true, label: 'Email', input_html: { autocomplete: 'email' }
        = f.button :submit, 'Recevoir les instructions', class: 'flex w-full justify-center rounded-md border border-transparent bg-indigo-600 py-2 px-4 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-xs hover:bg-indigo-700'

      div class="mt-6 text-center text-sm"
        = link_to 'Retour à la connexion', new_user_session_path, class: 'font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500'
